# backend_v2 biometric storage root (Phase 5; docs/BIOMETRIC_DATA_POLICY.md).
# No code writes here yet (Stage 1 is contracts/config only) — excluded now
# so Stage 2/3 never accidentally commits real biometric data later. Matches
# Settings.BIOMETRIC_STORAGE_ROOT's default (app/core/config.py); a
# deployment that overrides that path to somewhere outside the repo does
# not need this pattern at all.
backend_v2/var/biometric_data/

# Face-recognition model weights are deployer-supplied and never source artifacts.
*.onnx
*.dat
